# Dockerized Flask + Node.js Application

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates a multi-container application using:

* Frontend: Node.js with Express
* Backend: Flask
* Docker
* Docker Compose

The frontend form sends user data to the Flask backend for processing.

---

# Project Structure

```bash
project-root/
│
├── frontend/
├── backend/
├── docker-compose.yml
├── .gitignore
└── README.md
```

---

# Technologies Used

* Node.js
* Express.js
* Flask
* Docker
* Docker Compose

---

# Run the Project

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

---

# Access Application

Frontend:

```bash
http://localhost:3000
```

Backend:

```bash
http://localhost:5000
```

